Terminals unused in grammar

    COMMENTLINE
    CMD_OPTION


Grammar

    0 $accept: spice $end

    1 spice: netlist end

    2 end: end EOL
    3    | END

    4 netlist: netlist line
    5        | line

    6 line: component EOL
    7     | command EOL
    8     | EOL
    9     | error EOL

   10 component: resistor
   11          | capacitor
   12          | inductor
   13          | vccs
   14          | vs
   15          | vcvs
   16          | cs
   17          | cccs
   18          | ccvs

   19 command: print
   20        | dc
   21        | ac
   22        | tran
   23        | op
   24        | plot

   25 resistor: RESISTOR node node value

   26 capacitor: CAPACITOR node node value

   27 inductor: INDUCTOR node node value

   28 vccs: VCCS node node node node value

   29 vs: VS node node
   30   | VS node node value
   31   | vs RK_DC value
   32   | vs RK_AC value
   33   | vs RK_PULSE LBRACKET value value value value value value value RBRACKET
   34   | vs RK_SIN LBRACKET value value value value value RBRACKET

   35 vcvs: VCVS node node node node value

   36 cs: CS node node
   37   | CS node node value
   38   | cs RK_DC value
   39   | cs RK_AC value
   40   | cs RK_PULSE LBRACKET value value value value value value value RBRACKET
   41   | cs RK_SIN LBRACKET value value value value value RBRACKET

   42 cccs: CCCS node node VS value

   43 ccvs: CCVS node node VS value

   44 op: CMD_OP

   45 dc: CMD_DC
   46   | dc VS value value value
   47   | dc CS value value value

   48 ac: CMD_AC RK_DEC value value value
   49   | CMD_AC RK_LIN value value value
   50   | CMD_AC RK_OCT value value value

   51 tran: CMD_TRAN value
   52     | CMD_TRAN value value
   53     | CMD_TRAN value value value

   54 print: CMD_PRINT RK_AC
   55      | CMD_PRINT RK_DC
   56      | CMD_PRINT RK_OP
   57      | CMD_PRINT RK_TRAN
   58      | print VAR_V
   59      | print VAR_I

   60 plot: CMD_PLOT RK_AC
   61     | CMD_PLOT RK_DC
   62     | CMD_PLOT RK_OP
   63     | CMD_PLOT RK_TRAN
   64     | plot VAR_V
   65     | plot VAR_I

   66 node: STRING
   67     | INTEGER
   68     | RESISTOR
   69     | CAPACITOR
   70     | INDUCTOR
   71     | VS
   72     | VCCS

   73 value: VALUE
   74      | FLOAT
   75      | INTEGER


